            <title><![CDATA[87% of the Anthropic power will come from gas and 11% from coal in 2028 (883 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://betterdatacenterproject.com/2026/11/16/how-ai-is-powered-a-breakdown-of-byop-and-grid-power/</link>
