ag.imgix.net/2026/01/Seth_BG_Fig2.001-copy.jpg?fit=scale&amp;fm=pjpg&amp;h=1114&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.1&amp;w=1980&amp;wpsize=twentytwenty-fullscreen&amp;s=536c2eba6af9517c5b92a794e7165f8c 1980w, https://noemamag.imgix.net/2026/01/Seth_BG_Fig2.001-copy.jpg?fm=pjpg&amp;ixlib=php-3.3.1&amp;s=babce8303901866f753da6be2585e7d0 1563w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1563px) 100vw, 1563px"></p>
